      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: June 1929, New York City. In the heart of Manhattan, a grand banquet
          is underway. The clinking of glasses and lively music fill the gilded hall,
          as waiters in tailcoats weave through the crowd with practiced ease. Guests
          chatter enthusiastically about future investment opportunities.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 3
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 3
        originDialogueID: 1
        destinationConversationID: 3
        destinationDialogueID: 2
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
