      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You look at him, pondering his words, but hold back your answer. The
          noise of the banquet carries on, but your thoughts drift toward the uncertain
          future.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
